      "id": "claim_735cd1f130244c58a1f297299b827052",
      "statement": "NII effect per line = sign (+1 asset, -1 liability) x balance x beta x repricing factor x shock/10000, where the repricing factor counts only the 0-3m (month 1.5) and 3-12m (month 7.5) buckets over a 12-month horizon; assets use beta 1 and liabilities use deposit betas (0.45 consumer, 0.75 wholesale, 0 noninterest-bearing). The balance sheet is static.",
